":"text","value":"B. Q 质点比 P 质点更早迁移到 O 点"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. P 点刚开始振动时速度方向为 y 轴正方向"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. Q 质点振动的相位比 P 质点振动的相位落后 "},{"type":"math","value":"3\\pi"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"CD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q13","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2510","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"065cc6f0809a9dd0db9e43866396da496ada63a90d948d810c2b0919707202fe","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 如图所示，在 "},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":" 坐标平面的第一、第四象限内存在足够宽的垂直纸面向里的匀强磁场，磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_0"},{"type":"text","value":" ，同时放置有两个关于 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴对称且板间距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":" 的平行金属板 "},{"type":"math","value":"A, B"},{"type":"text","value":" ，两金属板间存在沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴负方向的匀强电场（图中未画出）。现有一质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电荷量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"q"},{"type":"text","value":" 的可视为质点的带正电金属小球，以速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_0"},{"type":"text","value":" 从坐标原点沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向做匀速直线运动后从两极板右端离开极板区域. 不考虑电场在两极板之外的效应, 重力加速度为 g. 下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/01bd6d08bdc3e45d4fcba52c36666cd1faec2e907beb2ad2d89cadacd38095fc.png","width":349,"height":218,"width_mm":40.903,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q13-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 小球离开两极板区域后可以运动到 x 轴的下方"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 两极板间的电场强度大小等于 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}v_{0}-\\frac{mg}{q}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 小球在运动过程中的最大速度等于 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2mg}{qB_{0}} - v_{0}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 小球在运动过程中偏离 x 轴的最大距离等于 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2mv_{0}}{qB_{0}} - \\frac{2m^{2}g}{q^{2}B_{0}^{2}}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BD","body":