, 内阻约 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" . 实验中要求待测水泥块两端的电压从零开始变化, 在图 2 中完成余下导线的连接.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b1d5d1a0848101d9a2c2897c565f4b0437db0af0cc06674c3bb45e6bc2ba0324.png","width":271,"height":197,"width_mm":31.762,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c5287bc8fdbd170af78259b6158aaa7d46f56754953308608adfba9f538fc026.png","width":328,"height":200,"width_mm":38.424,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图2\n(3)如图2,测量水泥块的长为a,宽为b,高为c.用伏安法测得水泥块电阻为R,则电阻率 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）（用R、a、b、c表示）。\n(4)测得不同压力 F 下的电阻 R，算出对应的电阻率 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho"},{"type":"text","value":" ，作出 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho - F"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像如图 3 所示.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/22c5a646943b1c5cd73715e7f534e0e80f238f85e99050ad9e1308997fa982b3.png","width":184,"height":170,"width_mm":21.467,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图3\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9823e494ee059d7bbd74d5253c91344bef207942735245f0086b8bafd19793d1.png","width":287,"height":163,"width_mm":33.621,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图4\n(5)基于以上结论,设计压力报警系统,电路如图4所示.报警器在两端电压小于或等于3 V时启动, "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为水泥块, "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为滑动变阻器,当 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑片处于某位置, "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 上压力大于或等于 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时,报警器启动.报警器应并联在（填空）两端(填“ "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ”或“ "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ”).\n(6)若电源 E 使用时间过长,电动势变小, "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 上压力大于或等于 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时,报警器启动,则 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" (填“大于”“小于”或“等于”).\n14 - Ⅲ.(2 分)用双缝干涉实验测量光的波长的实验装置如图 1 所示,则以下说法正确的是 （填空）(多选).\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e15d218d8c3bac00054c1c02bdfe0bb21cba87a3e763e001f424b046b5e9e39c.png","width":692,"height":183,"width_mm":81.187,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/543687d6623eab9abe5b99c4e0a8e1ca5d0b054cf22defd8ca571d52dfa2ebb8.png","width":160,"height":145,"width_mm":18.747,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图2\nA. 双缝应该放置在图 1 中 A 处\nB. 实验时应避免一次性将灯两端的电压调至额定电压，以免灯丝烧坏\nC. 测量亮纹之间的距离时，读数时分划板中心刻线应与某亮纹中心对齐\nD. 如图 2 所示手轮上的示数为 3.185 mm，这就是光源发出的光的波长"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14-I.(1)A(1分) (2)左端(1分) (3)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{x_2}{2T}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{x_2 - 2x_1}{T^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n解析:(1)研究匀变速直线运动的规律,无需满足重物的质量远小于小车的质量;安装器材时,应调节滑轮位置,让细线与木板平行,接通电源待打点计时器稳定工作后,再释放小车,所以应选A;(2)由于小车运动得越来越快,点迹会越来越稀疏,所以纸带左端与车相连;(3)B点的速度等于AC段的平均速度即"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{x_{2}}{2T}"},{"type":"text","value":",利用逐差法可知加速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{x_{2}-2x_{1}}{T^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":".\n14－Ⅱ.(1)1000(1分) (2)如图(2分) (3)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Rbc}{a}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分) (5)"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分) (6)小于(2分)\n解析:(1)由多用电表欧姆档的读数规则可知R=1 000 Ω;(2)由于R>"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{R_{V}R_{A}}"},{"type":"text","value":"可知电流表应采用内接法,要求水泥块两端电压从零开始变化,滑动变阻器应采用分压式连接方式;(3)由电阻定律可知"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho=\\frac{Rbc}{a}"},{"type":"text","value":";(5)根据图3可知压力越大电阻率越小,即电阻越小;回路中电流增加,"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"电压增加,"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"电压"},{"type":"text","value":"减小，而报警器在两端电压小于或等于"},{"type":"math","value":"3\\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":"时启动，故应将报警器并联在"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"两端；(6)电源电动势"},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":"减小，要使报警器启动，即"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"两端电压要仍为"},{"type":"math","value":"3\\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":"，根据串联分压有"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{1} = \\frac{R_{1}}{R_{2} + R_{1}} E"},{"type":"text","value":"，可知"},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":"减小需要"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"更大，又因为"},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":"越大"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"越小，可知"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"需要小于"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"."},{"type":"figure","src":"images/72cce5a790ff51f0f9ff65df9682a3b966c9f49ea11dfa086a313382d57ff675.png","width":314,"height":201,"width_mm":39.8},{"type":"text","value":"14-Ⅲ. BC(2分) 双缝应放置在"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"处，A选项错误；用双缝干涉实验测波长，应测出"},{"type":"math","value":"N"},{"type":"text","value":"条亮条纹的间距，然后除以"},{"type":"math","value":"N-1"},{"type":"text","value":"，得出相邻条纹的间距"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x"},{"type":"text","value":"，然后利用"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x = \\frac{L\\lambda}{d}"},{"type":"text","value":"求波长，D选项错误."}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q15","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2510","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"35a0d5749b83b47f77f1035d3271e884cf6628634bf1a66201cdf75467b85f1a","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. (8分)龙泉青瓷名扬天下,现代电子测温技术能够实现温度的精准控制从而制作出更加精细的青瓷制品.如图所示为某青瓷窑结构的示意图.某次烧制前,封闭在窑内的气体压强为 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}=1.0\\times10^{5}"},{"type":"text","value":" Pa,温度为室温 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}=27^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":" .烧制时为避免窑内气压过高,窑上有一个单向排气阀,已知当窑内气体温度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=727^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":" 时,单向排气阀开始排气,此后窑内气体压强保持不变, 温度逐渐升高至稳定烧制温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}=1027^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":" . 气体可视为理想气体. 求:\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a73831cad110d5a0615d1e5f8be16a74d509f4261ef830cd1934242840e52a70.png","width":236,"height":250,"width_mm":27.579,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)单向排气阀开始排气后窑内气体分子平均速率（填空）（填“增大”“减小”或“不变”），单位时间撞击单位面积窑壁的分子数（填空）（填“增大”“不变”或“减小”）；\n(2)排气阀开始排气时窑内气体的压强 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(3)本次烧制排出的气体占原有气体质量的比例."}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）（1）增大（1分） 减小（1分）\n（2）由题意可知，排气阀开始排气前，气体体积不变。\n初状态时"},{"type":"math","value":"p_0=1.0\\times10^5\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"，温度为"},{"type":"math","value":"T_0=(273+27)\\mathrm K=300\\mathrm K"},{"type":"text","value":"\n末状态时压强为"},{"type":"math","value":"p_1"},{"type":"text","value":"，温度为"},{"type":"math","value":"T_1=1000\\mathrm K"},{"type":"text","value":"\n对气体，由查理定律可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{p_0}{T_0}=\\frac{p_1}{T_1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n解得排气阀开始排气时窑内气体的压强为"},{"type":"math","value":"p_1=3.33\\times10^5\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）排出气体后，气体发生等压变化，由盖—吕萨克定律可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_1}{T_1}=\\frac{V_2}{T_2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"V_2=1.3V_1"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n则排出的气体的体积为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta V=V_2-V_1=0.3V_1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n则排出的气体占原有气体的质量比为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\Delta m}{m}=\\frac{\\Delta V}{V_2}=\\frac{3}{13}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q16","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2510","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"57f75f863427cbacb6a2d1ae64fb794cf4acc1846c2445dece8ef3a6779e22d1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. (11分)如图,MNP为一段光滑轨道,其中MN段是半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R=5.5\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的圆弧形轨道,M与圆心的连线与竖直方向夹角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"53^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" . NP是水平足够长直轨道,MN与NP段在N点平滑连接. 滑块A从距M点高度 "},{"type":"math","value":"H=3.2\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" 处水平抛出,恰好能从M点切入轨道. 在水平轨道某位置静止放置一长 "},{"type":"math","value":"L=0.5\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的木板B,木板左右两侧各有一固定挡板. 木板紧靠右挡板放置一滑块C. 滑块A在NP轨道上与木板B发生碰撞,碰撞后立即从轨道移去滑块A. 若 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{A}=m"},{"type":"text","value":" ,且 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{B}=m_{C}=2\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" ,滑块A、C均可视为质点,A与B之间、C与挡板之间的碰撞均为弹性碰撞. B、C 之间的动摩擦因数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu = 0.5"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/61d62d0e21f7f0ead034227035b6927664ff4b4c57f43198530781f408f3cd11.png","width":591,"height":145,"width_mm":69.411,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1) 滑块 A 到达 M 点时的速度；\n(2) 滑块 A 与木板 B 碰后木板的速度；\n(3) 滑块 C 与左右两侧挡板碰撞的总次数.\n\n原卷公共参数：重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin37^\\circ=0.6"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos37^\\circ=0.8"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.(11分)(1)滑块A从距M点高度H=3.2m处水平抛出,根据动能定理求解"},{"type":"math","value":"mgH=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{M}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{M}=\\frac{v_{1}}{\\cos53^{\\circ}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n联立解得滑块A到达M点时的速度："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{M}=10~m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"，和水平方向夹角53°沿轨道切线方向（1分）\n(2)从M点到与木板B碰撞，由动能定理可得："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{M}^{2}+mgR(1-\\cos53^{\\circ})=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=12~m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"A与B发生弹性碰撞，有："},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{0}=mv_{3}+2mv_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{3}^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}2mv_{2}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{3}=-\\frac{1}{3}v_{0}=-4~m/s,v_{2}=\\frac{2}{3}v_{0}=8~m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"，方向向右（1分）\n(3)因C与挡板间的碰撞为弹性碰撞，B和C系统动量守恒，最终B与C共速做匀速直线运动，\n故有："},{"type":"math","value":"2mv_{2}=4mv_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n系统机械能损失为："},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta E=\\frac{1}{2}2mv_{2}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot4mv_{\\text{共}}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"系统损失的机械能转化为摩擦生热，有："},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta E=Q=2\\mu mgs"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得：s=3.2m（1分）\n滑块C相对木板B上来回滑动的距离为3.2m，故C与左右两挡板碰撞的次数为："},{"type":"math","value":"n=\\frac{s}{L}=6.4"},{"type":"text","value":"故滑块C与两侧挡板共碰撞6次。（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q17","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2510","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"d6ad1a984dc243dc8adb1227656c16421448b4c1a3c57151fc4c16f241a9077d","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (12 分) 如图所示, 某兴趣小组设计了一种水平电磁弹射系统. 该系统由输出电流恒为 "},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":" 的电源、间距为 "},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":" 的水平金属导轨、可在导轨上滑行的“H”型导电动子（动子由两根电阻为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" 的金属杆和一根绝缘横档组成, 其上固定了模型飞机）及开关 S 组成. 导轨间 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{1}A_{2}A_{3}A_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 区域存在方向竖直向下、磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场. 接通开关 S, 动子 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 杆在磁场中贴紧 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{1}A_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 边从静止开始运动, 所受阻力与其速度成正比, 比例系数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"k"},{"type":"text","value":" . 动子运动距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" （已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{0}>L_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"）时, 动子开始匀速运动; 当 "},{"type":"math","value":"t=t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时, 动子 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 杆到达 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{3}A_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 瞬间, 安装在“H”上的飞机被弹射系统以相对于“H”2 倍的速度弹出, 同时 S 断开, 磁场的磁感应强度被控制为: "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{t}=B_{0}-\\frac{B_{0}}{t_{0}}(t-t_{0})"},{"type":"text","value":" . 当 "},{"type":"math","value":"t=2t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时, "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 棒恰好停在 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{3}A_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" . 已知动子质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" , 飞机质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":"，在运动过程中，动子始终与导轨保持良好接触，忽略导轨电阻。求：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f8a79592582dff657f8a0a4c4a129c07252fd34f9c6ae0838a48ed0c304c4052.png","width":510,"height":207,"width_mm":59.96,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)S接通瞬间，动子所受安培力 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(2)飞机弹射出去前,动子的最大速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(3)飞机弹射出去前瞬间恒流源提供的电压 U;\n(4)飞机弹射出去后,动子所受合外力的冲量 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{\\text{合}}"},{"type":"text","value":" 及通过 a 杆的电量 q."}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.(12分)(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}=\\frac{B_{0}Id}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，方向向右（3分）\n(2)由牛顿第二定律，动子载着飞机加速时："},{"type":"math","value":"F'_{A}-f=ma,f=kv"},{"type":"text","value":"，当"},{"type":"math","value":"F'_{A}-f_{m}=0"},{"type":"text","value":"时，动子速度最大，得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}=\\frac{F'_{A}}{k}=\\frac{B_{0}Id}{k}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3)飞机弹射出去前，由能量守恒有："},{"type":"math","value":"UI=I^{2}\\frac{R}{2}+F'_{A}v_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n得："},{"type":"math","value":"U=I\\frac{R}{2}+\\frac{B_{0}^{2}Id^{2}}{k}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(4)飞机弹射前后，水平方向动量守恒"},{"type":"math","value":"(M+m)v_{m}=Mv_{1}+mv_{2},v_{2}=2v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=\\frac{(M+m)B_{0}Id}{k(M+2m)}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n动子最后停下，可得动子所受合外力的冲量为："},{"type":"math","value":"I_{\\text{合}}=0-Mv_{1}=-\\frac{(M+m)MB_{0}Id}{(2m+M)k}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n动子在进入减速过程中，通过a杆的电量为："},{"type":"math","value":"q=\\overline I\\,t_0=\\frac{\\overline E}{2R}t_0=\\frac{\\Delta\\Phi}{2R}=\\frac{B_0dL_1}{2R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（3分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2510","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"469289c6cd0591d025f434e393a343f4e9087cb222d6ad5cfecf7cefcc88bc4e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (13分)如图1所示,回旋加速器由两个D型盒组成.圆形匀强磁场区域以O点为圆心,磁场垂直纸面,磁感应强度大小为B,加速电压的大小为U,质量为m、电荷量为q的粒子从O点附近飘入加速电场,多次加速后粒子经过P点绕O点做圆周运动,半径为R.为将粒子引出磁场,在P位置安装一个“静电偏转器”,如图2所示.偏转器的两极板M和N厚度均匀,构成的圆弧形狭缝圆心为Q、圆心角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":" ,当M、N间加有电压时,狭缝中产生电场强度大小为E的电场,使粒子恰能通过狭缝,粒子在再次被加速前射出磁场,不计M、N间的距离,且忽略粒子在电场中的加速时间,加速过程中不考虑相对论效应和重力作用.求:\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6fe587c229b66f66b6f7c47698f1e54af75ff6dbc26afa6b3d5044f3cc2f32a8.png","width":325,"height":276,"width_mm":38.114,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/75ce44bf9863bec821713cc7a283086e82f1a1816951945dd9370cf9eb89218d.png","width":322,"height":272,"width_mm":37.804,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2510-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图2\n(1)粒子加速到 P 点所需要的时间 t；\n(2)粒子在圆弧形狭缝中运动的轨迹半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"r_{Q}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(3)“静电偏转器”N板的最大厚度 "},{"type":"math","value":"d_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(4)磁场区域的最大半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ."}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.(13分)(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\left(\\frac{qB^{2}R^{2}}{2mU}-1\\right)\\frac{\\pi m}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{qB^{2}R^{2}}{qRB^{2}-mE}"},{"type":"text","value":"(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"2\\left(\\sqrt{R^{2}-\\frac{2mU}{qB^{2}}}-\\sqrt{R^{2}-\\frac{4mU}{qB^{2}}}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"(4)"},{"type":"math","value":"R+\\frac{2mER}{qB^{2}R-mE}\\sin\\frac{\\alpha}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解析:(1)设粒子在P的速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{P}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则根据"},{"type":"math","value":"qvB=m\\frac{v_{p}^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n可知半径表达式为"},{"type":"math","value":"R=\\frac{mv_{p}}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"对粒子在静电场中的加速过程，根据动能定理有"},{"type":"math","value":"nqU = \\frac{1}{2} m v_{P}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）粒子在磁场中运动的周期为"},{"type":"math","value":"T = \\frac{2\\pi m}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）粒子运动的总时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"t = (n - 1)\\times \\frac{T}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\left(\\frac{qB^2R^2}{2mU} -1\\right)\\frac{\\pi m}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(2)设粒子在偏转器中的运动半径为"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{Q}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则在偏转器中，要使粒子半径变大，电场力应和洛伦兹力反向，共同提供向心力，即"},{"type":"math","value":"q v_{P}B - qE = m \\frac{v_{P}^{2}}{r_{Q}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{Q}=\\frac{qB^{2}R^{2}}{qRB^{2}-mE}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3)由粒子的运动半径"},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\frac{mv}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"，结合动能表达式"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k}=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"变形得"},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\frac{\\sqrt{2mE_{k}}}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n则粒子加速到 P 前最后两个半周的运动半径为"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{1}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2m(E_{kP}-qU)}}{qB},r_{2}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2m(E_{kP}-2qU)}}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"由几何关系有"},{"type":"math","value":"d_{\\mathrm{m}}=2(r_{1}-r_{2})"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n结合"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{kP}=\\frac{(qBR)^{2}}{2m}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"d_{\\mathrm{m}}=2\\left(\\sqrt{R^{2}-\\frac{2mU}{qB^{2}}} - \\sqrt{R^{2}-\\frac{4mU}{qB^{2}}}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(4)设粒子离开偏转器的点为"},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":"，圆周运动的圆心为"},{"type":"math","value":"O'"},{"type":"text","value":".由题意知，"},{"type":"math","value":"O'"},{"type":"text","value":"在"},{"type":"math","value":"EQ"},{"type":"text","value":"上，且粒子飞离磁场的点与"},{"type":"math","value":"O, O'"},{"type":"text","value":"在一条直线上，如图所示."},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8dd9b345665963520f9910e7c725698d5507c0c6d1e0270614c1fe73949e01ec.png","width":392,"height":279,"width_mm":49.7},{"type":"text","value":"粒子在偏转器中运动的圆心在"},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":"点，从偏转器飞出，即从"},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":"点离开，又进入回旋加速器中的磁场，此时粒子的运动半径又变为"},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":"，然后轨迹发生偏离，从偏转器的"},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":"点飞出磁场，那么磁场的最大半径即为"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{\\mathrm{m}} = OF = R + OO'"},{"type":"text","value":"将等腰三角形"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta OO'Q"},{"type":"text","value":"放大如图所示.虚线为从"},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":"点向"},{"type":"math","value":"OO'"},{"type":"text","value":"所引垂线，虚线平分"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"角，则"},{"type":"math","value":"OO' = 2(r_{Q} - R)\\sin \\frac{\\alpha}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）解得最大半径为"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{\\mathrm{m}} = R + \\frac{2mER}{qB^{2}R - mE}\\sin \\frac{\\alpha}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f80592f165dfdfc3df0a5dc7e0f3fd3c723d55406d0dd00ea9c7766a01980562.png","width":227,"height":185,"width_mm":28.7}]}}]}
